Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep running, Luffy! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.00,0:02:55.20,Title,,0,0,240,,{\fad(700,1000)}Sabo's Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to put\Nout the fire, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta abandon the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea is blocked off anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That filthy cheat thinks\Nhe can get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must Grey Terminal be an assault to\Nmy senses even in its final moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light is far too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are sorry, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, allow us to close the curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Papa, how come we want to\Nburn everybody in Great Terminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they people, too, just like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They chose to live meaningless lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they had chosen the path of\Nhigh-class nobility like you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't be in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's their fault for\Nbeing born all poor and dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, now enough about those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get some\Nstudying done before bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blocked off here\Ntoo. Damn it. We just keep
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,losing ground I don't\Nwant to die like this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think all those old guys got away\Nsafe who cares about them we're in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap I can't tell where are we who said\Nyou two brats were allowed to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bluejam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were escaping\Nafter the fire got lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a sort of irony to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.98,0:05:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans are strange creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hit rock bottom, and all\NI can do is laugh about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're acting really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, run for it! Run him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did this job together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we get to die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to die with you losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't give up that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you still haven't told me\Nwhere you're hiding that treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends don't keep\Nsecrets from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save it for you\Nbefore the fire reaches it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is in danger, and\Nall you care about is treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you don't want it, then\Nyou might as well tell me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to stop another tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already saw my ship reduced to charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a shame if that\Nhappened to your treasure, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hard work and for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your own treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent forever collecting that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would Sabo think? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo would understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treasure isn't important anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters\Nis getting out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six years we've collected treasure\Nfor six years and hit it in this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:07:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. It's okay, Luffy.\NThis won't be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you where it is, now let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, about that treasure.\NLet's go. You can lead. You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't leave us time to\Nescape, and I'm not dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the damn map!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not above stealing from\Nchildren or murdering them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have my revenge and believe\Nme those nobles will regret
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the day they cross blue jam and\Nto think you called one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother they act\Nlike a little money and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,influence makes them a gift\Nto the rest of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it gives them the right to\Nlook down on us like we're trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up Sabo isn't like\Nthat. Take it back. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is face it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, you stayed together, but he was\Nlooking down on you the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His parents are loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any of the\Nproblems that you or I deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used you idiots to get some kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was just bored, then\Ngot a taste of real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he ran back home to his rich daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo is our brother! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo just wants to be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell away from Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You screwed a big time, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try that crap again before I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare hurt my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but what are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't too late, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes, you got roughed up\Npretty bad, Luffy. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's safe in Hightown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't with us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that bandit\Ngorilla from Mount Grove.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bandit, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorilla, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not the point here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, like it or not,\Nthese kids are my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, we gotta get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing to gain\Nhere, you little idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this place is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Blue Jam is a hardened criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little kid like you shouldn't\Nbe fighting him to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! Damn it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Luffy, and get your\Nbutts back to the hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of Ace, no matter\Nhow many asses I gotta kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come home safe, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that. How brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the end of the day, you're just\Na woman and a child against a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like those odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only two kinds of people\Nsurvive in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strong and the cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravery doesn't enter\Nthe picture, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything was fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this happen so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it made a path through the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did somebody do that on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can get out of this hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ship here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's waiting down by the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who and I don't know how,\Nbut I think they're here to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, before the fire comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen nobles do some dreadful things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this takes the cake\Nabsolutely reprehensible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywho, this locale is rather out of\Nthe way. How did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you keeping an eye on this country or
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps is there something\Nhere of interest to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening here will happen in\Nthe rest of the world soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human beings can't be thrown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A world that allows that must change!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how long it takes, I will\Nstop out this misery and injustice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here because if\NI do, then I'll never be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children born in this country must\Nhave a future that they can believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's freedom you want, so long as\Nyou have the will to fight for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are welcome aboard this ship!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(520,690)}Goa Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(805.333,691.333)}"Royal Palace"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that wall will protect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like the fire could\Nspread here any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely they'll lead us into\NHightown until it passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those gates are so tight,\Neven a flea can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how their friends cried,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace and Dadan did not emerge from\Nthe flames consuming Gray Terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Ace and Dadan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for right now, we just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The military is down in Great Terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word is they were sent in to clean up\Neverything after the fire died down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by clean up, I mean take\Ncare of any remaining evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that extends to\Nkilling off the survivors, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave him out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we have to let Zoro\Nknow that we didn't die!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.65,Captions,,0,0,25,,{\fad(500,0)}The remains of the Gray Terminal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orders say to shoot any\Nsurvivors we find on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what survivors? It's weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've hardly seen any corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fire was pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably burned up their bones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was up all night, scared that\Nfire would get over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have known they wouldn't\Nburn decent people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard Blue Jam's ship\Nwasn't quite so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope the bastard\Nwas on it when it burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it will\Nalways end this way, Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police and military\Nhave photos of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get out of Hightown,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let alone this house, unless\NI expressly permit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you on guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll look into\Ngetting you new uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, but we have other duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a nobleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll have a\Nword with your superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sabo, it's not too late for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, you'll lock yourself in\Nyour room and learn to be a proper noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be cruel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I am certainly capable of it\Nand anything else I so desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could disappear,\Njust like your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Stella can study hard, then so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will work out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then your parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who work so hard to build a proper\Nfuture for you, can finally be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't that be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be nice for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're sad, I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dependable as always, Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got that big ceremony\Ncoming up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's buy you some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll look so handsome\Nfor the Celestial Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Study hard, and I'll check\Nyour homework tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a pleasant afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I know you're okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you died in that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could see you, even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if people follow me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll find out you're still alive\Nand you'll be in danger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks nice from the outside,\Nbut this house is a birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose my mind if I have to\Nstay in this stuffy, stuck-up place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I found freedom, but\Nit seems to keep slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take good care of Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be back until\Nlate. Yes, sir. As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After much anticipation,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the day of the World Nobles' visit\Nto the Goa Kingdom arrives at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lavish ceremony is prepared to greet\Nhis ship as it enters the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a ship leaving port?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fishing boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're blocking their path!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, it's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little boy is steering that boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he's a noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But surely all the\Nfamilies are here watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice weather today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just perfect for setting sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, crap! That's mine! It was stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a Jolly Roger on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to be a pirate or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid's flag isn't the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's heading straight for the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragon\Nisn't gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either you lose that boat\Nor you lose your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, kid! Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of anything\Nas long as I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to be far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my own dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them a warm welcome, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's one big ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could run right over me easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's avoid that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a first for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons hardly\Never make visits like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope nobody mucks this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't burn all those\Npeople for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that wretched little thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to be a fishing boat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm the captain of a\Nbig ship like that some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, Luffy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but\Nit's still too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got banged up pretty bad and\Nthe place is crawling with soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.13,0:24:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come down and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.64,0:24:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now, we just need to have faith\Nthat the boss and ace are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger went back to look\Nfor him, so be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.53,0:24:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is hard on everyone, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fishing boat has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.86,0:24:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid shouldn't have gotten\Nin the Celestial Dragon's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he shoot at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.79,0:24:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jalmec, there's a child on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who flies a black\Nflag is a filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His age is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:24:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.10,0:25:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commoner should know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.06,0:25:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cross my ship,\Nyou stupid pirate brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.22,0:25:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.13,0:25:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they fire on\Nthat ship a second time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.91,0:25:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to make\Nthe celestial dragon mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.60,0:25:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an important ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear the wreckage already!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:25:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I got news.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace and the boss are...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.76,0:26:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's badly wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.94,0:26:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them both inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.15,0:26:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.07,0:26:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.94,0:26:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously think I was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.46,0:26:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.37,0:26:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit crying already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.82,0:26:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm standing right in front of you, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.42,0:26:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy on the kiddo for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.70,0:26:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's just happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.52,0:27:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened the night of the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all came back here with Luffy,\Nso we haven't heard a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us everything that\Nhappened to you and the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.57,0:27:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, we fought Blue Jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We barely defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we tried to catch up to\Nyou guys as fast as we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.28,0:27:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the fire was blocking our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it through the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.80,0:27:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dadan was suffering from\Nsome serious burns, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we managed to get to the\Nriverside in the In-Between Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.18,0:27:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went into town to steal medicine\Nand grab whatever food I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.38,0:27:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no doctor, but I did what\NI could to save Dedan's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an ordeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.24,0:28:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, all that matters is that\Nboth of you are back safe. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.00,0:28:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fire was huge, and they\Nwere hunting down survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo must think we're dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kingdom's likely full of lowly\Nplebeians that will get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be on the lookout for any disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.86,0:28:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Sava's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.28,0:28:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least Ace finally\Nmade it back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even carried Dadan home with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.58,0:28:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, when I came for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.88,0:28:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but get fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.66,0:28:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid if I run, that I might\Nleave something important behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:28:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy was there, so I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough to explain,\Nbut I think that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.00,0:29:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when he faced a wave of\Nfar more powerful enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger would never think of running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.86,0:29:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that fool have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running away is a strategy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.90,0:29:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For him, it wasn't even\Nan option. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat means leaving people behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Roger ran, he'd be abandoning\Nhis crew, the people he loved most.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when you think about it,\Nit's not that he wouldn't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.34,0:29:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather, he made sure the enemy\Ncouldn't go after his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always protected them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.36,0:29:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a different kind of\Nanimal in times like those.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.28,0:29:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He once wrecked a whole\Ncountry's army because
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some soldiers decided to\Nmouth off about his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.18,0:29:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was angry,\NRoger would get violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.14,0:29:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was selfish and short-tempered,\Nbut he wore his heart on his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.58,0:29:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was like a boy that never grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For better or worse, his\Nchildhood was a lot like Aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.58,0:30:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain he went through just made him\Nhold on tighter to the ones he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.44,0:30:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger could be a very reckless man, but\Nhe lived to become king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No easy feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.06,0:30:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite his flaws and his bad reputation,\Nhis crew still trusted him completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.36,0:30:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I may be a marine, but\Neven I can't help respecting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to take care of Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one taking care of him, you ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you got something\Nyou want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People all over the\Nworld still hate Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though Ace holds\Na grudge against him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.50,0:30:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really are like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.92,0:30:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, wonder who's gonna win?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dogra!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.34,0:30:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went to town to look\Nfor Asa to dawn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.36,0:30:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise, they came back home already!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.78,0:30:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.30,0:31:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.68,0:31:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.26,0:31:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.88,0:31:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying to me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.82,0:31:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you even joke\Nabout that kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.76,0:31:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.67,0:31:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you exactly what I saw, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.58,0:31:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.82,0:31:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything happened so fast,\NI could hardly believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.64,0:31:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like a nightmare, but\NI know that was Sabo. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.64,0:31:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We watched him go back with his\Ndad to their home in Hightown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.48,0:31:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't have seen him\Nout at sea by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.72,0:31:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.63,0:31:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo is with his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's like us know how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.94,0:31:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know what it means to be turned\Naway from your home, to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.58,0:31:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo didn't want to be a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.40,0:31:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was truly happy, he\Nwouldn't have gone out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Sabo I saw wasn't just\Nsailing away from his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was flying a Jolly Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:32:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.36,0:32:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.74,0:32:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I had parents, I was still alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo, why didn't we go back into\Ntown and bring him back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.46,0:32:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.92,0:32:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where I can find\Nthe bastard that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat him to\Ndeath with my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.50,0:32:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.98,0:32:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.89,0:32:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.96,0:32:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.68,0:32:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of that, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're so tough when you're\Nreally just a cocky, stubborn little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you do against a world noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.98,0:32:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's just some thug?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just some no-name kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.80,0:32:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die and nobody will give a crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.78,0:32:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swept under the rug the very next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was this whole rotten\Ncountry that killed Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.44,0:32:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rotten world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.10,0:32:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can a scrawny brat\Nlike you do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.82,0:32:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father, on the other hand,\Nchanged the world with his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you become a man as important as him,\Nthen and only then can you take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.54,0:33:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tie this fool up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.98,0:33:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.56,0:33:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.96,0:33:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.98,0:33:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit crying like a girl\Nor else I'll... Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.38,0:33:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come to your senses now, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, untie him. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.94,0:33:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to keep your cool, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.46,0:33:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.82,0:33:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was crying all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.12,0:33:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.74,0:33:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:33:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.44,0:33:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have sent it before he left!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.42,0:34:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I think it's really from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.14,0:34:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.12,0:34:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't head to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.14,0:34:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for Luffy and me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you guys weren't hurt in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.72,0:34:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you both, but\Nsomething tells me you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.66,0:34:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a surprise to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time you get this\Nletter, I'll be long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.20,0:34:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm heading out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.28,0:34:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing led to another, and I\Ndecided to set out before you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.46,0:34:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know where I'm going yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.26,0:34:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do know that anywhere\Nwill be better than this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.10,0:34:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, I haven't\Ngiven up on my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.12,0:34:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.50,0:34:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a head start, but I'm\Nsure you'll catch up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we meet again, we'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.62,0:35:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have our reunion on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.04,0:35:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three pirate captains,\Nmore free than the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.02,0:35:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Ace, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us do you think\Nis the real big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.28,0:35:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, wherever we sail, we'll\Nalways have our brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.00,0:35:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may sound kinda cheesy, but that bond\Nis what I treasure most in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.66,0:35:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is still weak, and a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.56,0:35:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows if he'll ever grow out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.48,0:35:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's still our little brother,\Nso please take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G-g-g-g-g

